 "notes": [
  "Deck buttons: the DECK A/C switch picks which channel the left side uses (0x91 deck A, 0x93 deck C); DECK B/D the same for the right side (0x92 B, 0x94 D). Pressing a switch sends the old deck's note with 00 and the new deck's note with 7F (seen 2026-11-20: 90 3B 00, 90 3A 7F).",
  "SHIFT (note 0E on the deck's channel) makes the deck buttons send note + 40H while held; the LED stays on the unshifted note.",
  "Relative controls send 40H - N (left/CCW) or 40H + N (right/CW); N grows with turning speed.",
  "LEVEL meters: CC value 00-20 all off, 21-41 1 LED, 42-62 2, 63-83 3, ..., 105-119 5, 126-127 all.",
  "Hardware check 2026-11-20 (Rafael, deck A and B selected): every top-row LED and every deck A/B button LED lights on its own button; deck C/D not checked."
 ],
